Only the path data was used. It has been reformatted and re-typed; no source
code from that project is included. The projection is Albers USA, in which
Alaska and Hawaii are repositioned insets rather than true scale.

The District of Columbia outline is NOT from the above source, which contains
no DC entry. It is generated independently — see src/maps/README.md.
